## Model card

- **Name:** GPT Realtime 2.1
- **Short description:** OpenAI’s speech-to-speech conversational model with enhanced alphanumeric acoustic fidelity, low-latency turn-taking, and adaptive test-time reasoning (per local metadata).
- **Provider / access:** OpenAI Realtime API. Local metadata lists `openai/gpt-realtime-2.1`, session/context 128K, and audio/text pricing tiers.
- **Release / knowledge:** Not clearly established from accessible official sources in this pass. Knowledge cutoff not stated.
- **IDs:** `gpt-realtime-2.1`, `openai/gpt-realtime-2.1`.
- **Context window:** 128,000 tokens total per session (local metadata).
- **Modalities:** Audio, text, and image input; audio and text output.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $0.06/min audio input, $0.24/min audio output; text $2.50/1M input, $10.00/1M output (local metadata).
- **Architecture:** Proprietary speech-to-speech realtime model. Architecture/parameter details not publicly disclosed.

